{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-operations","title":"治理与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-governance-approval","title":"发布治理与审批","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-governance-approval","wordCount":1470,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-recovery-strategy","title":"回滚与恢复策略","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/rollback-recovery-strategy","wordCount":1380,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-metrics-health","title":"发布度量与健康指标","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-metrics-health","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 治理与运营\n\n工具链解决\"怎么发得快\"，治理与运营解决\"怎么发得稳\"。本章关注发布工程中人与流程的层面：审批机制确保变更经过充分评估后才进入生产；回滚与恢复策略为发布失败提供安全网；发布度量与健康指标让团队持续观测发布系统本身的健康状况。\n\n三篇文档覆盖\"谁批准发\"、\"发坏了怎么办\"、\"怎么量化发布质量\"——构成发布工程的反馈闭环。\n"}